```text
fiscal year 2012.  Joe Dougherty, Director, Cheyenne Transit Program, clarified this is an annual
submission request for federal grant funding and the requested amount is $744,355.00.  Mr. Dougherty
referenced a memorandum dated July 25, 2011 that he had submitted to members of the governing body
regarding the grant request, noting last year’s requested amount was $807,660.00.  There being no
further comments or input, Mayor Kaysen advised the purpose of the hearing had been met and closed
the hearing.
Ordinance amending Title 17, Zoning, Chapter 17.08, Zoning Districts Established and Section
17.08.040 Cheyenne City Map of the Cheyenne City Code, by changing the zoning classification from
CB Community Business District (Conditional) to LI Light Industrial District for Lots 2 & 3, Block 1,
Hutchins Corner, 2nd Filing, Cheyenne, Wyoming (located west of and adjacent to Hutchins Drive,
south of Campstool Road).  Reporting for Public Services Committee, Mr. Collins moved to approve
on second reading, seconded by Ms. Ash.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the
governing body present.
Resolution authorizing the filing of an application with the Federal Transit Administration, an
operating administration of the United States Department of Transportation, for Federal Transportation
Assistance authorized by Title 49, United States Code, Section 5307 (Cheyenne Transit Program).
Reporting for Finance Committee, Mr. Valdez moved to adopt, seconded by Mr. Pierson.  Motion
carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body present. (#5298)
[CA]
Resolution certifying that the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne approves of the Albin
and Burns projects to be submitted to the State Loan and Investment Board for the 2011 Countywide
Consensus Block Grant funding.  Motion (per Consent Agenda) carried.  (#5299)
[CA]
Resolution authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for CFT Cheyenne Dell
Range, a replat of a portion of Lot 1, Block One, Cole Fire Station Addition, Cheyenne, Wyoming
(located north of Dell Range Boulevard, west of Grandview Avenue).  Motion (per Consent Agenda)
carried.  (#5300)
[CA]
Resolution authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for WYODIGS
Properties Subdivision, a replat of Lots 5, 6, & 7, Block 4, Campstool Addition, Third Filing, Cheyenne,
Wyoming (located at the southeast corner of the intersection of Industry Court and Industry Drive).
Motion (per Consent Agenda) carried.  (#5301)
Resolution authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for Hospital Center,
1st Filing, a replat of Lots 1 thru 8, Block 138; Lots 1 thru 8, Block 139; Lots 1 thru 8, Block 172; Lots
1 thru 8, Block 173; Lots 1 thru 8, Block 200; vacated 16-foot alley in Blocks 138, 139, 172, 173, and
200; vacated 23rd Street between House Avenue and Evans Avenue; vacated House Avenue between
