Phase II Project and authorizing the Mayor, City Clerk and Director of the Board of Public Utilities to
execute all related loan documents.  Motion (per Consent Agenda) carried.  (#5303)
[CA]
Resolution approving a project agreement with the Wyoming Water Development Commission
for a grant in the amount of $14,029,800 for the Southern Water Transmission Main Phase II Project
and authorizing the Mayor, City Clerk and Director of the Board of Public Utilities to execute all related
